# --- Generated plot outputs ---
# The plotter writes its output next to the data files. The CN-60-cryst PNG
# under examples/ is kept on purpose (it's the README screenshot); everything
# else the script produces is regenerable, so it stays untracked.
*.svg
examples/*.svg
!examples/CN-60-cryst_pawley_01.png
